@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+Add weekly subscriptions support
+
+- Add `--every week` option to `subtrack add` command
+- Weekly plans charge every 7 days from their first charge date
+- Monthly cost calculated as price × 52 ÷ 12, rounded to nearest cent
+- Add comprehensive tests for weekly functionality
+- Fix renewals sorting to use actual dates instead of text labels
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
